 fantastic  theory in store for you guys about the  ancient kingdom and skypia so if you're  interested in that let me know in the  comments and going back to nl who now  has this entire army of robots on the  moon one more important thing is the  name of his home that he destroyed  burka  you see burqa is not only the name of  the ancient moon city but also a real  historical place the real-life burqa was  one of the most important trade centers  in scandinavia during the viking age and  what island is viking themed yes you  exactly albath 10 points to hufflepuff  and we know that elbaf has this giant  tree growing into the sky and we also  know that there is a proper entrance to  the sky islands somewhere in the new  world  coincidence i think not now all of this  implies to me that one of the most  interesting characters with an  unfinished character arc should come  back at some point in the future and  even if he doesn't nl wasn't just a  villain he was  an experienced  [Music]

